aseball vs Cecil College 4/22/26 @ Harford Sports Complex","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/4/29/harford-community-college-to-host-2026-njcaa-region-20-baseball-tournament.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[],"gallery_id":0,"writer":null,"ranking":5,"locked_ranking":false,"id":6468,"content_id":"6468","content_title":"Harford Community College to Host 2026 NJCAA Region 20 Baseball Tournament","content_date":"2026-04-29T10:52:00","content_url":"https://harfordathletics.com/news/2026/4/29/harford-community-college-to-host-2026-njcaa-region-20-baseball-tournament.aspx","content_image_url":"https://harfordathletics.com/images/2026/4/27/SB109186.jpg","date":"2026-04-29T10:52:00"},{"title":"Fighting Owls Baseball Soars to Historic Heights, Program Record Winning Streak","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":null,"teaser":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\">What began as a steady opening month has evolved into one of the most dominant stretches in Harford Community College baseball history. The Fighting Owls enter early April riding a program-record 34-game winning streak – surpassing the old record of 32, set in 2019 – powering their way to a 35–3 overall record and a spotless 16–0 mark in Maryland JUCO play. The run has elevated Harford from Region 20 contender to a national statement, as evident in the Fighting Owls receiving votes in this week's NJCAA Division I Baseball rankings.</p>\r\n","type":null,"byline":"By Rocco Geppi","app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball, General","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BASE","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"BASE","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":"PL920B1B437EE2BF25","facebook":null,"twitter":"@hcc_owlbaseball","instagram":"","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,